  "id": "cognitive-style",
  "term": "cognitive style",
  "definition": "Cognitive style is a personality-related way of processing information that can affect how well a person reasons. In this source, it is described through the contrast between field-independent and field-dependent styles, with field-independent people showing stronger analytical performance, especially on more complex reasoning problems.",
